-- title:
--   Lift finite generation from top components to bounded generators
-- statement:
--   If the degree-D weighted components generate an algebra over which the polynomial ring is finite, and the original generators have weighted degree at most positive D, then the polynomial ring is finite over the algebra generated by the original family.
-- source:
